  <head>
    <title>US20020034689A1 - Porous film and separator for battery using the same 
        - Google Patents</title>

    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="referrer" content="origin-when-crossorigin">
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://patents.google.com/patent/US20020034689A1/en">
    <meta name="description" content="
     Provided is a porous film obtained by melt-kneading a high-molecular-weight polyolefin having a weight-average molecular weight of not less than 5×10 5 , a thermoplastic resin having a weight-average molecular weight of not more than 2×10 4  and fine particles, molding the kneaded matter into a sheet, and then stretching the sheet. The porous film can be easily and simply prepared, and has a high piercing strength, and hence can be advantageously used as a separator for a battery, particularly for a lithium secondary battery.  
   
   ">
    <meta name="DC.type" content="patent">
    <meta name="DC.title" content="Porous film and separator for battery using the same 
       ">
    <meta name="DC.date" content="2001-06-13" scheme="dateSubmitted">
